{title: Blessed Jesus Hold My Hand}
{key: F}

{comment: Chorus}
[F]Jesus hold my hand
I [Bb]need thee every [F]hour
[F]Through the sinking sand
Pro[G7]tect me by thy [C7]power.
[F]Hear my feeble plea
O Lord [Bb]look down on [F]me
When I [Bb]need the light to [F]guide me day and [D]night
[G]Blessed Jesus [C7]lord hold my [F]hand.

{comment: Verse 1}
[F]As I travel through this pilgrim land
There is a [Bb]friend who walks with [F]me
[F]Leads me safely through the sinking sand
It is the [G7]Christ at Calvary.[C7]
[F]This would be my prayer dear Lord each day
To [Bb]help me do the best I [F]can
For I [Bb]need Thy light to [F]guide me day and [D]night
[G]Blessed Jesus [C7]lord hold my [F]hand.
